/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Automatic\040detection\040of\040actionable\040radiology\040reports\040using\040bidirectional\040encoder\040representations\040from\040transformers\056)
/Author (Yuta\040Nakamura\054\040Shouhei\040Hanaoka\054\040Yukihiro\040Nomura\054\040Takahiro\040Nakao\054\040Soichiro\040Miki\054\040Takeyuki\040Watadani\054\040Takeharu\040Yoshikawa\054\040Naoto\040Hayashi\054\040Osamu\040Abe)
/Subject (Background\040It\040is\040essential\040for\040radiologists\040to\040communicate\040actionable\040findings\040to\040the\040referring\040clinicians\040reliably\056\040Natural\040language\040processing\040\050NLP\051\040has\040been\040shown\040to\040help\040identify\040free\055text\040radiology\040reports\040including\040actionable\040findings\056\040However\054\040the\040application\040of\040recent\040deep\040learning\040techniques\040to\040radiology\040reports\054\040which\040can\040improve\040the\040detection\040performance\054\040has\040not\040been\040thoroughly\040examined\056\040Moreover\054\040free\055text\040that\040clinicians\040input\040in\040the\040ordering\040form\040\050order\040information\051\040has\040seldom\040been\040used\040to\040identify\040actionable\040reports\056\040This\040study\040aims\040to\040evaluate\040the\040benefits\040of\040two\040new\040approaches\072\040\0501\051\040bidirectional\040encoder\040representations\040from\040transformers\040\050BERT\051\054\040a\040recent\040deep\040learning\040architecture\040in\040NLP\054\040and\040\0502\051\040using\040order\040information\040in\040addition\040to\040radiology\040reports\056\040Methods\040We\040performed\040a\040binary\040classification\040to\040distinguish\040actionable\040reports\040\050i\056e\056\054\040radiology\040reports\040tagged\040as\040actionable\040in\040actual\040radiological\040practice\051\040from\040non\055actionable\040ones\040\050those\040without\040an\040actionable\040tag\051\056\04090\054923\040Japanese\040radiology\040reports\040in\040our\040hospital\040were\040used\054\040of\040which\040788\040\0500\05687\045\051\040were\040actionable\056\040We\040evaluated\040four\040methods\054\040statistical\040machine\040learning\040with\040logistic\040regression\040\050LR\051\040and\040with\040gradient\040boosting\040decision\040tree\040\050GBDT\051\054\040and\040deep\040learning\040with\040a\040bidirectional\040long\040short\055term\040memory\040\050LSTM\051\040model\040and\040a\040publicly\040available\040Japanese\040BERT\040model\056\040Each\040method\040was\040used\040with\040two\040different\040inputs\054\040radiology\040reports\040alone\040and\040pairs\040of\040order\040information\040and\040radiology\040reports\056\040Thus\054\040eight\040experiments\040were\040conducted\040to\040examine\040the\040performance\056\040Results\040Without\040order\040information\054\040BERT\040achieved\040the\040highest\040area\040under\040the\040precision\055recall\040curve\040\050AUPRC\051\040of\0400\0565138\054\040which\040showed\040a\040statistically\040significant\040improvement\040over\040LR\054\040GBDT\054\040and\040LSTM\054\040and\040the\040highest\040area\040under\040the\040receiver\040operating\040characteristic\040curve\040\050AUROC\051\040of\0400\0569516\056\040Simply\040coupling\040the\040order\040information\040with\040the\040radiology\040reports\040slightly\040increased\040the\040AUPRC\040of\040BERT\040but\040did\040not\040lead\040to\040a\040statistically\040significant\040improvement\056\040This\040may\040be\040due\040to\040the\040complexity\040of\040clinical\040decisions\040made\040by\040radiologists\056\040Conclusions\040BERT\040was\040assumed\040to\040be\040useful\040to\040detect\040actionable\040reports\056\040More\040sophisticated\040methods\040are\040required\040to\040use\040order\040information\040effectively\056)
/Keywords (11\040Sep\0402021\054\040BMC\040Medical\040Informatics\040and\040Decision\040Making\054\040University\040of\040Tokyo)
>>
